The UE sends a BEARER RESOURCE MODIFICATION REQUEST that contains:

* the EPS bearer identity of the bearer in the EPS bearer identity for packet filter IE;  
* a Traffic Flow Aggregate IE with the TFT operation code set to “no TFT operation”;  
* the packet-filter identifier(s) to which the GBR change applies in the Packet filter identifier parameter;  
* the new GBR value in the Required traffic flow QoS IE.
